  ## 🧠 Forensic Mindset & Clue Map
  When dealing with a 1GB raw disk image with no hints, a human investigator looks for:
  1. User Home Directory: Who was using this machine, and what were they doing? (/home/yone)
  2. Artifacts & Files: Pictures, text notes, chat logs, browser history, emails.
  3. The "Tutorial" Clue: Often, challenge creators leave an intentional conversation showing how their system works.
  4. The Challenge Title: "UnforgottenBits" strongly hints at file slack space (bits left behind in unused cluster sectors).
