  ### Step 6: Decrypt the Flag

  Now you have all three pieces: the ciphertext, the cipher parameters, and OpenSSL:

    openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d \
      -S 2350e88cbeaf16c9 \
      -K a9f86b874bd927057a05408d274ee3a88a83ad972217b81fdc2bb8e8ca8736da \
      -iv 908458e48fc8db1c5a46f18f0feb119f \
      -in out7.enc \
      -out finallyReleased.txt

